沙布防官张启山赶到，发现地下的山体被掏空，尽头是一堵数百米厚的人工巨墙，401部队痕迹至此切断。齐铁嘴判断墙体为阳宅结构，强拆必塌，唯有吴老狗的犬可破机关。张吴两家有仇，齐铁嘴硬着头皮上门求援。张启山则在废弃砖窑发现当年窑工的尸体竟然排成了倒八卦阵，墙上还留着挑衅的字迹。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,2596][637,2654]" /><node index="3" text="39 分钟" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,2668][229,2723]" /><node index="4" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[63,2172][665,2723]" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[700,2172][1302,2723]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[728,2200][1274,2501]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[728,2200][1274,2501]" /></node><node index="1" text="第2集 · 张启山和吴老狗达成合作" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[728,2526][1274,2585]" /><node index="2" text="张启山与吴老狗会面，吴老狗扔出尹新月的二响环，逼他在“救妻”与“救兵”间二选一。张启山制伏吴老狗后选择谈判，吴老狗开出条件，要张启山事成后退出九门，张启山应允。尹新月自行逃脱，痛揍吴老狗后安然返回。霍仙姑因家族债务，被迫答应丁千岁充当眼线，监视张启山的探查行动。地下平台，失踪的401部队士兵从墙洞现身与守卫诡异换防，钟表再次指向12点08分。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[728,2596][1274,2654]" /><node index="3" text="39 分钟" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[728,2668][866,2723]" /><node index="4" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[700,2172][1302,2723]" /></node><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1337,2172][1440,2723]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yfuse" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" lo